## 2. Data Acquisition and Exploration

The MIT-BIH database uses a modified lead II configuration sampled at 360 Hz. Following AAMI standards, we'll map the original 15 beat types into 5 superclasses: Normal (N), Supraventricular ectopic (S), Ventricular ectopic (V), Fusion (F), and Unknown (Q).

```python
# Cell 2: Download and load MIT-BIH database
def download_mitbih():
    """
    Downloads MIT-BIH database if not present
    """
    # Check if data exists
    if not os.path.exists('mitbih_data'):
        os.makedirs('mitbih_data')
    
    # List of all 48 recordings
